{"id":"n61076-8-6","stage":1,"title":"깨끗이 · 公平地","scene":"公平较量","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61076-8-6-1","ko":"나와 정정당당하게 싸우자.","zh":"和我光明正大地打一架吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나와","meaning":"和我","explanation":"나：我；-와 表示“和”，나와 싸우자 是“和我较量吧”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나와","audio":"/audio/3e680d9cb0a070926232.mp3"}},{"text":"정정당당하게","meaning":"堂堂正正","explanation":"정정당당하다：堂堂正正；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"정정당당하다","audio":"/audio/26c03818dd26e8fa2293.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75904","senseId":"1","lemma":"정정당당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정정당당하게","audio":"/audio/c031fbe9f3ecf072a328.mp3"}},{"text":"싸우자.","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸우자","audio":"/audio/92f94ef49312482c631e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"26c03818dd26e8fa","term":"정정당당하다","zh":"堂堂正正","audio":"/audio/26c03818dd26e8fa2293.mp3","entryId":"75904","definition":"态度、手段正当且光明正大。","pronunciation":["정ː정당당하다"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c662a9642654438a8c62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61076-8-6-2","ko":"좋아. 한번 깨끗이 붙어 보자고!","zh":"好啊，那就公平地较量一场吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"来一场、试一回","explanation":"한번：试一次；这里加强邀约较量的语气。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"깨끗이","meaning":"光明正大、公平地","explanation":"깨끗이：行为端正、公平；与打架较量连用，并非指身体清洁。","readings":[{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61076","senseId":"8","lemma":"깨끗이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨끗이","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3"}},{"text":"붙어","meaning":"较量、交手","explanation":"붙다：这里指双方交手较量；-어 连接后面的辅助动词 보다。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"21","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙어","audio":"/audio/eff24bb76023f0eae58c.mp3"}},{"text":"보자고!","meaning":"来试试吧！","explanation":"-어 보다 表示试着做；-자고 加强一起较量的提议语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보자고","audio":"/audio/9be5d44290fe71e6cc6c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"来一次、试一回","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"尝试做某事一次；这里邀请对方较量一场。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"356f24a2b3817821","term":"깨끗이","zh":"光明正大、公平地","audio":"/audio/356f24a2b3817821ba78.mp3","entryId":"61076","definition":"行为公平、手段正当；这里形容较量方式。","pronunciation":["깨끄시"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"较量、交手","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"在比赛或争斗中交锋；这里指与对方打一场。","pronunciation":["붇따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94eb98e45683da384e92.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61076","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"8","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6336,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["和我光明正大地打一架吧。","好啊，那就公平地较量一场吧！","妈妈，我希望炒年糕的酱汁能再甜一点。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["和我光明正大地打一架吧。","好啊，那就公平地较量一场吧！","妈妈，我希望炒年糕的酱汁能再甜一点。"],"answer":1}]}
